  "prefLabel": "Eth 212.01 Record of the Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eth 212.01 Record of the Hearing. The committee shall record the hearing by audio recording or other method that will provide a verbatim record. The recording shall be retained by the committee for 4 years from the date of the hearing.\n\nSource. #12617-A, eff 9-6-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/eth100-200.html"
